‎IMPORTANT RULES WHATSAPP KE
1. ‎Template Message: Agar 24 hours se baat nahi hui to pehle approved template bhejna parega
2. ‎Opt-in: Sirf unhi ko bhejo jinhone permission di ho
3. ‎Rate Limit: 1000 msg/min. Isliye 50ms delay rakha
